1476 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (UNDERSTANDING & MASTERING WILLPOWER IS SIMPLE & IT IS THE WAY TO CREATE CHANGE. START BY AVOIDING EVENTS & ACTS OUTSIDE OF YOUR CURRENT HABITS, THIS WAY YOU WILL HOPEFULLY BE ABLE TO PREVENT THE DEPLETION OF YOUR WILLPOWER BAR. ONCE YOU ARE AWARE OF YOUR WILLPOWER LIMITS & WORKINGS, ADD ONE DAILY HABIT WHICH IS THE MOST IMPORTANT TO YOUR CONTEXT. NOT TWO OR THREE. ONE. FOR LIFE IS CHAOTIC & YOU WILL NEED WILLPOWER RESERVE, IF YOU LACK WILLPOWER WHEN AN EVENT OCCURS, YOUR PROGRESS WILL DIMINISH. FOCUS ON YOUR HABIT UNTIL IT BECOMES SUBCONSCIOUS.)
