/ActualText (LEPTIN GREATLY RELIES ON FIBERS TO LET YOU KNOW WHEN YOUR BODY IS FULL. MOST PROCESSED FOODS REMOVE FIBERS FOR THIS REASON. IF YOU DO NOT FEEL FULL, YOU BUY & CONSUME MORE. FIBERS ARE ALSO NEEDED FOR VARIOUS BODILY FUNCTIONS & SYSTEMS. PLANT-BASED WHOLE FOODS CONTAIN ALL OF THE FIBERS YOU NEED. IF YOUR CONCERN IS WEIGHT, EATING THESE FOODS & REMOVING THE "NORMAL' ONES WILL IMPROVE IT.)
